  x86 defconfig, clean, gcc                28.6s    28.2s    -0.47s (-2%)
  x86 defconfig, clean, clang              29.1s    28.7s    -0.45s (-2%)
  x86 allmodconfig, touch mm/vma.c, gcc    25.7s    23.7s     -2.0s (-8%)
  x86 allmodconfig, touch mm/vma.c, clang  24.1s    22.5s     -1.6s (-7%)

